{"total_count":2,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8380","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8380/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8380/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8380/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8380","id":3119107963,"node_id":"I_kwDOAacf88656c97","number":8380,"title":"xds/balancer: Re-evaluate increasing `loadStoreTimeout` in clusterimpl balancer","user":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":528927681,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1Mjg5Mjc2ODE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/P2","name":"P2","color":"610B0B","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":687192383,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2ODcxOTIzODM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Type:%20Internal%20Cleanup","name":"Type: Internal Cleanup","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":"Refactors, etc","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7326492378,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAacf888AAAABtLFm2g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Area:%20xDS","name":"Area: xDS","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Includes everything xDS related, including LB policies used with xDS.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-06-04T21:02:55Z","updated_at":"2025-06-04T21:04:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8313","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The new LRS client, introduced in [#8250](https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8250), attempts to send a final load report to the LRS server when its `LoadStore.Stop()` method is called. \n\nThe `Stop(context)` function uses a context with a deadline as a safeguard to prevent indefinite blocking. However, the function does not send the final report immediately. Instead, it signals the underlying stream to send the report during its next scheduled reporting cycle. This means if the deadline is too short than the remaining time until the next reporting interval, the `Stop()` operation will time out before the client even has a chance to attempt the final report.\n\nAs part of [#8310](https://www.google.com/search?q=https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8310), the clusterimpl balancer now uses this new LRS client and calls `LoadStore.Stop()` with a hardcoded 1-second deadline.\n\nThis fixed timeout may not be sufficient. Load balancing control planes like Traffic Director can have a LoadReportingInterval that is significantly longer than one second. In such cases, the final load statistics would consistently be lost.\n\nAlthough the previous internal grpc xdsclient load report functionality did not have this feature of making last load reporting attempt before closing so switching to new LRS client is not changing any existing behavior, we should still re-evaluate that the 1-second deadline. It should ideally be increased to align with the maximum expected load reporting interval to ensure the final report is sent most of the time.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8380/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8348","id":3082383190,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAacf886XLRP7","number":8348,"title":"xdsclient: fix unexpectedly large LoadReportInterval in initial load report request","user":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":586671344,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY2NzEzNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Type:%20Bug","name":"Type: Bug","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7326492378,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAacf888AAAABtLFm2g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Area:%20xDS","name":"Area: xDS","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Includes everything xDS related, including LB policies used with xDS.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/milestones/71","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/milestone/71","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/milestones/71/labels","id":12657604,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAacf884AwSPE","number":71,"title":"1.73 Release","description":"","creator":{"login":"eshitachandwani","id":59800922,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODAwOTIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59800922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani","html_url":"https://github.com/eshitachandwani","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eshitachandwani/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":83,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-04-02T10:01:20Z","updated_at":"2025-09-10T10:39:53Z","due_on":"2025-05-27T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-06-05T12:13:24Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-05-22T07:40:12Z","updated_at":"2025-11-23T02:03:40Z","closed_at":"2025-05-26T04:35:11Z","assignee":{"login":"purnesh42H","id":12795451,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk1NDUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12795451?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H","html_url":"https://github.com/purnesh42H","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/purnesh42H/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/pulls/8348","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8348","diff_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8348.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/8348.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-26T04:35:11Z"},"body":"Internal bug: b/416260484\r\n\r\nThe `lastReportedAt` field is uninitialized during reporter construction, defaulting to the `Zero` timestamp. This results in an excessively large `LoadReportInterval` (calculated as Now() - lastReportedAt) for the initial load report. Initializing `lastReportedAt` to Now() during construction will ensure the `LoadReportInterval` is accurately approximated for the first report.\r\n\r\nRELEASE NOTES:\r\n- xdsclient: fix unexpectedly large LoadReportInterval in initial load report request.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/8348/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}